<Information title="Privacy" description="Hosting, analytics and email on the Kogen website.">
<p>This notice covers the public website at kogen.dev.</p>
<h2>Hosting and analytics</h2>
<p>Cloudflare Pages hosts this website. Cloudflare receives the network information needed to deliver pages and protect the site. See the <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare privacy policy</a> for details.</p>
<p>The site uses Plausible for website analytics. The About, Contact and Privacy pages do not load analytics. The <a href="https://plausible.io/data-policy">Plausible data policy</a> explains how it collects and handles analytics data.</p>
<h2>Email and external links</h2>
<p>If you email <a href="mailto:contact@kogen.dev">contact@kogen.dev</a>, your message and the contact details you provide are handled through the email service used for that conversation.</p>
<p>External websites have their own privacy notices. For questions about privacy on this site, <a href="/contact/">contact Kogen</a>.</p>
</Information>
